Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, Alina
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:03.72,memories,,0,0,0,,Master, it’s me, Yom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.80,0:01:06.93,memories,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was a hundred days since you meditated
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.01,0:01:08.31,memories,,0,0,0,,It's time to go outside
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:15.10,memories,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.69,0:01:21.94,memories,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:26.74,memories,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:28.78,memories,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:31.87,memories,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:33.79,memories,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:36.58,memories,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:45.55,memories italics,,0,0,0,,- Poor boy\N- Poor thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.63,0:01:48.10,memories italics,,0,0,0,,- Holy heaven\N- Incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.18,0:01:50.81,memories italics,,0,0,0,,- He must have frozen to death\N- It seems so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.89,0:01:53.64,memories italics,,0,0,0,,- I feel so sorry for him\N- Poor baby
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.73,0:01:54.94,memories italics,,0,0,0,,- It’s a pity\N- How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.02,0:01:56.69,memories,,0,0,0,,What's going on here? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.77,0:01:58.94,memories italics,,0,0,0,,A homeless boy died
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:01.61,memories,,0,0,0,,He was just a child. I feel so sorry for him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:04.74,memories italics,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.51,0:02:29.09,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,As you always wanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:33.35,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I will quietly say goodbye to you, master
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:42.98,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I feel so sorry for him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:45.74,memories italics,,0,0,0,,It seems he is an orphan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:47.32,memories,,0,0,0,,Shall we hold a funeral for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:48.57,memories,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:49.70,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Maybe cremate...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:51.95,memories italics,,0,0,0,,and scatter the ashes over Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:54.95,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:56.00,memories,,0,0,0,,are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:00.50,memories italics,,0,0,0,,- That’s it...\N- How...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:03.63,memories,,0,0,0,,- Where is he going?\N- Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:13.35,memories,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.69,0:03:25.78,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Child
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.86,0:03:28.20,memories,,0,0,0,,Did you just tell me to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:31.45,memories,,0,0,0,,What a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.62,memories,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe you already burned my body
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:39.16,memories,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:44.59,memories,,0,0,0,,If I had come a little later, you would have burned my cane too
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:47.26,memories,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:51.14,memories,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:54.43,memories,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:57.52,memories,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:05.94,memories,,0,0,0,,M-master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:08.49,memories,,0,0,0,,I only temporarily left my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:10.36,memories,,0,0,0,,to check if I reached Hwansu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:12.82,memories,,0,0,0,,after one hundred days of meditation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.41,0:04:17.20,memories,,0,0,0,,But I noticed that my body was burning, so I quickly moved into another
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:19.50,memories,,0,0,0,,But it's too late
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:25.84,memories,,0,0,0,,So you are in the body of this boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:28.13,memories,,0,0,0,,Is it really you, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:29.55,memories,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:32.63,memories,,0,0,0,,I am Lee Chul, your master
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:34.05,memories,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.93,0:04:37.56,memories,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:39.81,memories,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.69,0:04:52.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I am a nomad,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.21,0:05:04.29,italics,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:08.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you call me to find the nomad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:10.51,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s exactly what I’ll do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:12.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I can
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:14.38,general text,,0,0,0,,recognize nomads
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:50.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Has anyone else seen your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:56.34,memories,,0,0,0,,This is an umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:05:58.93,memories,,0,0,0,,Can be used as a cane
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.68,0:06:02.68,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:06.02,general text,,0,0,0,,In the capital no one else knows that I am sighted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:10.23,general text,,0,0,0,,People will think that bandits fought here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:20.74,general text,,0,0,0,,You should have stopped looking for me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.58,memories,,0,0,0,,So I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.42,memories,,0,0,0,,So Yi, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:33.05,memories,,0,0,0,,I am Kim from the village of Sari
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:35.55,memories,,0,0,0,,You made a mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:45.98,memories,,0,0,0,,We barely know each other. He hardly knows me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:47.10,memories,,0,0,0,,About that man
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.73,0:06:49.15,memories,,0,0,0,,need to be taken care of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:02.87,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no need to kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:05.50,general text,,0,0,0,,If he had gone to Sari, we would never have met again
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:06.66,general text,,0,0,0,,But you met
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:09.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Sari Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:13.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that where you stayed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.01,0:07:18.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I was hiding there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:22.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Hidden from these thugs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.06,0:07:27.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone left there who can recognize you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:31.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t get close to anyone so that they wouldn’t recognize me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:34.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I was a thief there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:36.23,general text,,0,0,0,,- What is this?\N- Money
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:39.49,general text,,0,0,0,,It will be suspicious if the money doesn’t disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.95,0:07:42.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Keep it for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:59.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I did not want to harm anyone from the village of Sari
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:13.52,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok in the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:15.98,offscreen,,0,0,0,,If we meet, will we have to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:21.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Trader Kim from Sari Village is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.78,0:08:23.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, he just arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:25.91,general text,,0,0,0,,He is in the last room on the second floor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:57.98,italics,,0,0,0,,Madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:09.70,general text,,0,0,0,,What brought you to this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:12.25,general text,,0,0,0,,None of your business. You haven't seen me here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:14.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Madam, are you really playing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:18.50,general text,,0,0,0,,into gambling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:20.46,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Gambling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:24.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Who do you take me for? Am I some kind of simpleton, in your opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:25.72,general text,,0,0,0,,No, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:29.51,general text,,0,0,0,,But you lied to me when you said the jade wasn't broken
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:33.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Given your ability to lie without a twinge of conscience,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:36.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe you have a talent for gambling
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:42.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to the merchant for tickets
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Tickets for the show were sold out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:46.74,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why I came here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:48.78,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Entrance ticket\N Magi of Seochon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.70,0:09:52.50,general text,,0,0,0,,- You have two tickets\N- I’m going with my mother
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell anyone that you saw me here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want any misunderstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Who knows
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm not as good at lying as you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:03.42,general text,,0,0,0,,If someone asks, I’m not sure I can lie
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:07.64,general text,,0,0,0,,But for your sake I will try
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.35,0:10:14.14,italics,,0,0,0,,I just happened to meet her here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:28.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is the head of Sosnovy Bor here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:36.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope he's not here for tickets
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:41.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I won’t be able to go to the show with Dong Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.21,0:11:23.50,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:26.17,general text,,0,0,0,,killed him
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:29.22,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.97,0:11:31.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:32.97,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s really not me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:35.02,general text,,0,0,0,,He was already dead when I arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:41.52,general text,,0,0,0,,He was killed not long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:43.36,italics,,0,0,0,,He was killed with one blow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:45.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Skilled swordsman
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.61,0:11:49.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I swear it wasn’t me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:51.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t even have a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I think one person killed them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:17.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are these men?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:22.44,general text,,0,0,0,,These are thugs who arrived in the capital recently
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.52,general text,,0,0,0,,They have arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:28.57,general text,,0,0,0,,with trader Kim from the village of Sari?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:29.95,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:34.57,general text,,0,0,0,,But I remember how those thugs started a fight with him a couple of days ago
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:40.96,general text,,0,0,0,,They wanted to know where the fraudster who lived in Sari was located
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:42.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Sari Fraud?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:44.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:48.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:55.14,general text,,0,0,0,,He was here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.68,0:12:58.97,general text,,0,0,0,,She ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:10.82,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:13.41,offscreen,,0,0,0,,What were these bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:18.83,memories,,0,0,0,,They wanted to know where the fraudster who lived in Sari was
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.16,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Could they mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:25.33,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What kind of life did Moo Deok live?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:28.55,memories,,0,0,0,,Have you met So Yi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.63,0:13:30.80,memories,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she did this time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.88,0:13:32.67,memories,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with her
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:35.89,general text,,0,0,0,,So I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:39.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is So Yi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:44.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I haven’t seen her myself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:47.94,general text,,0,0,0,,But she quarreled with all the guards, and even slapped one in the face
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:49.94,italics,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they remembered her face
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:54.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Madam, not a single guard came today
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.11,0:13:56.16,italics,,0,0,0,,- They both didn’t come?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:58.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Strange. They never miss work
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:07.25,general text,,0,0,0,,We're sorry. We shouldn't have treated the magician like that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:10.38,general text,,0,0,0,,But is this really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.46,0:14:11.88,italics,,0,0,0,,"Magu"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:13.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you lie about being a magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:16.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I will soon become him
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:20.68,general text,,0,0,0,,And even more powerful than you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:26.48,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare a fake talk to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.98,0:14:28.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I will talk down to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.94,0:14:32.78,general text,,0,0,0,,and you will address me with respect. Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:41.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Run after him
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.33,0:14:42.74,general text,,0,0,0,,This is your job
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:53.09,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a girl named Moo Deok from the village of Sari in Jwiseonru?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:56.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know her. Were you looking for her that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:15:00.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask her for a favor and return something
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:02.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Deok is not in Jwiseonru
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:06.02,general text,,0,0,0,,She is a maid in the Jang family, this is the family of Gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:08.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:11.31,general text,,0,0,0,,It looks like she really can see now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.19,0:15:14.28,general text,,0,0,0,,She probably fooled you too
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.36,0:15:16.03,general text,,0,0,0,,They brought her to Chwisonra, they thought she was blind,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.11,0:15:18.53,general text,,0,0,0,,But everyone was surprised when she opened her eyes and ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:22.12,general text,,0,0,0,,But she is not a fraudster like me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:24.74,general text,,0,0,0,,How can she see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:30.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:32.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:35.17,general text,,0,0,0,,You saw my face, I can’t leave you alive
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.38,0:15:37.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:05.29,general text,,0,0,0,,If she could see, then she could recognize me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:09.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she a maid of the Chan family?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:12.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to visit her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:17.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Did Mu Dok commit murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:21.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Several men were killed in the inn
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:23.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok was there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.89,0:16:27.64,general text,,0,0,0,,But Moo Deok is not strong enough to kill someone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:29.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Especially several men
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:31.90,general text,,0,0,0,,It was done by a skilled swordsman
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:33.90,general text,,0,0,0,,If it's not her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:36.61,general text,,0,0,0,,the magician must have helped her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.11,0:16:39.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:41.95,general text,,0,0,0,,that you suspect our master
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:44.32,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.41,0:16:47.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Wook is now in the palace with Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:51.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:53.88,general text,,0,0,0,,It couldn’t be Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:56.21,general text,,0,0,0,,She has no reason to kill
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:57.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:00.92,general text,,0,0,0,,how well do you know Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:03.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:09.02,general text,,0,0,0,,what kind of life did she lead before she started working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.06,0:17:11.94,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:13.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Killed -
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.81,0:17:16.44,general text,,0,0,0,,the man I asked about Moo Deok's past
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:20.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Bandits who may have been looking for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:22.61,general text,,0,0,0,,also dead
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:28.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Obviously, she would come under suspicion,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:30.87,general text,,0,0,0,,but she ran away instead of proving her innocence
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:32.50,general text,,0,0,0,,What am I sure of -
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:37.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok is hiding something,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:40.71,general text,,0,0,0,,what cannot be disclosed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:53.27,general text,,0,0,0,,The guards live over there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.35,0:17:55.19,general text,,0,0,0,,It would be faster
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:58.44,general text,,0,0,0,,draw her portrait and look for it yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:00.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know what she looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:03.03,general text,,0,0,0,,- I met her when I was still blind\N- I thought you weren’t
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:08.32,general text,,0,0,0,,You say that you were blind, then you say that you were not
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:12.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know what’s going on there, but your life is clearly not sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:18.00,general text,,0,0,0,,So you don’t know her by sight, but she knows you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:21.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe it’s dangerous to look for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:23.97,general text,,0,0,0,,What if she killed those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.05,0:18:25.55,general text,,0,0,0,,And suddenly it will harm you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:29.72,general text,,0,0,0,,It is more dangerous to be a suspected leader
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:35.23,general text,,0,0,0,,You can get hurt too, but you paid the merchant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:36.56,general text,,0,0,0,,That is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.56,0:18:39.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand what you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.52,0:18:41.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:44.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Pretend you don’t know anything
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:47.32,italics,,0,0,0,,Someone died!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:09.01,italics,,0,0,0,,Guardian Li and Guard Chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:20.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Hwangsu will give incredible strength
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:24.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought all nomads were monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:27.57,general text,,0,0,0,,But you have gained youth and immortality
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:31.16,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s clear now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:33.87,general text,,0,0,0,,why did everyone want an ice stone for alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:37.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone wanted him so much, they fought forever
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Therefore, this magic is forbidden
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:40.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.67,0:19:43.59,general text,,0,0,0,,You can recognize them
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.67,0:19:45.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Look around
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.63,0:19:48.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Are there nomads in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:05.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Just looking at a person is not enough
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:07.44,general text,,0,0,0,,If the blue mark is not visible
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.53,0:20:09.45,general text,,0,0,0,,or signs of savagery,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:11.61,general text,,0,0,0,,they cannot be distinguished from ordinary people
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.53,0:20:15.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Then how do you recognize them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:18.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Fear of being caught
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:22.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Fear of petrification
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:28.46,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to bring this fear out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.05,0:20:31.84,general text,,0,0,0,,So you instill fear in them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.93,0:20:33.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I disappointed you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:35.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Instead
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.64,0:20:38.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I will give you a gift
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.89,0:20:40.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Gift? What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:43.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Dog
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:45.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:48.07,general text,,0,0,0,,He is very smart and obedient
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:50.36,general text,,0,0,0,,He is now standing at the gates of the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:52.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I quote it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.57,0:20:54.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Since this is a gift, then of course
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:20:56.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring the dog
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.58,0:20:58.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:00.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I want you to bring him
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:06.34,general text,,0,0,0,,If you manage it, I will reward you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:39.08,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just run away with Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:42.71,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Then everyone will understand
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:47.17,voiceover,,0,0,0,,And now I am weak and will not protect my teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:54.22,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Master Li is going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.00,0:22:24.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.25,0:22:26.62,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.13,0:22:34.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this fluffy a gift from the master to the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.76,0:22:38.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li said the dog will follow you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:40.64,general text,,0,0,0,,But be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.56,0:22:44.73,general text,,0,0,0,,What is the danger of taking him to the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:46.48,general text,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.02,0:22:48.98,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.77,0:22:51.32,general text,,0,0,0,,He brought Gwiga to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.65,0:22:53.94,general text,,0,0,0,,But Gwigu is a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:56.70,general text,,0,0,0,,How could he bring him to the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.78,0:23:02.20,general text,,0,0,0,,My teacher Seo Kyung used Gwiga
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.29,0:23:05.04,general text,,0,0,0,,for searching for relics created by dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:07.87,general text,,0,0,0,,using an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:09.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.75,0:23:12.71,general text,,0,0,0,,But I thought it couldn’t be used anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:14.71,general text,,0,0,0,,because his urn is broken
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.80,0:23:15.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:20.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I transferred Gwigu's soul into the body of a dead dog
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.14,0:23:24.68,general text,,0,0,0,,The dog I brought,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.73,0:23:26.98,general text,,0,0,0,,this is Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.90,0:23:30.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwigu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.48,0:23:36.57,general text,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.11,0:23:39.95,general text,,0,0,0,,How many of us are in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.53,0:23:41.70,general text,,0,0,0,,More than ten
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.28,0:23:43.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Transferred to Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.74,0:23:46.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Sent a man, they will arrive soon
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:16.82,general text,,0,0,0,,This meeting is organized in order to establish peace between the magicians and the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.49,0:24:20.82,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince visited Sosnovy Bor, and he honored you by inviting you here
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.91,0:24:22.45,general text,,0,0,0,,And you want to bring it here
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.53,0:24:24.70,general text,,0,0,0,,monster, without asking His Majesty’s permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.78,0:24:26.79,general text,,0,0,0,,He gave his permission
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.87,0:24:28.66,general text,,0,0,0,,And now Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.75,0:24:31.46,general text,,0,0,0,,not a monster, because in the body of an ordinary dog
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.54,0:24:34.67,general text,,0,0,0,,So, he won’t be able to harm the nomad, even if he finds him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.75,0:24:38.26,general text,,0,0,0,,He will start barking, so we will understand
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.55,0:24:40.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Woof
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.80,0:24:42.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.57,0:25:01.99,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,This is a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.86,0:25:05.95,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,As we thought, nomads in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.46,0:25:13.58,general text,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.33,0:25:17.55,general text,,0,0,0,,So there are nomads in my palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.34,0:25:20.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Seems like it
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.09,0:25:23.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Then why are you just standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.68,0:25:26.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Go and catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.51,0:25:29.39,general text,,0,0,0,,As I said, a dog is a gift
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.47,0:25:32.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it here
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.44,0:25:34.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Using it you will find everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.73,0:25:36.36,general text,,0,0,0,,nomads in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.19,0:25:38.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Take him, we don’t need him
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.61,0:25:42.19,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you bring this monster here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.28,0:25:43.90,general text,,0,0,0,,The king suffers from anxiety
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.99,0:25:46.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to harm him with this monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:52.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother, we ourselves invited Master Li to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:54.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t get involved in this
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.54,0:25:59.13,general text,,0,0,0,,It is Jeonbugwan's responsibility to protect the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.21,0:26:01.46,general text,,0,0,0,,If dark magic was used in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.55,0:26:03.38,general text,,0,0,0,,they'll figure it out
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.47,0:26:06.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to see a monster in the body of a dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.09,0:26:07.89,general text,,0,0,0,,nor the people of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.43,0:26:11.31,general text,,0,0,0,,You are trying to humiliate us
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.35,0:26:15.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop them, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.09,0:26:45.67,general text,,0,0,0,,The son of Gwangju Jeonbugwan must protect the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.76,0:26:47.72,general text,,0,0,0,,and you brought this monster here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.60,0:26:51.68,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a gift from Master Li to the king
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.76,0:26:53.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Let us inside
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.39,0:26:55.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I was ordered to bring him
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.36,0:27:02.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.44,0:27:04.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Then try to log in
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.94,0:27:06.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Kill this beast that entered the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.32,0:27:12.28,memories,,0,0,0,,If you handle it, I will reward you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.87,0:27:15.62,voiceover,,0,0,0,,So he asked me to bring the dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.07,0:27:45.69,italics,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this is Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.28,0:27:48.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I will get rid of these insolent people from Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.45,0:27:52.45,general text,,0,0,0,,We are here at his invitation, and we haven’t finished talking
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.53,0:27:54.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu, you shouldn’t get involved in this
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.66,0:27:56.95,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you bring this monster here without permission?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.04,0:27:58.66,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of behavior is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.75,0:27:59.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Silence
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.39,0:28:18.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Guards! Don't stand there! Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.27,0:28:24.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.48,0:28:26.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop both
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.15,0:28:28.40,general text,,0,0,0,,If a fight starts, our relationship will end
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.99,0:28:29.95,general text,,0,0,0,,We must fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.03,0:28:32.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Pine forest brought this beast here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.03,0:28:34.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Chonbugwan must protect us
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.37,0:28:37.20,general text,,0,0,0,,- Father!\N- Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.87,0:28:42.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I order everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.00,0:28:46.09,general text,,0,0,0,,stop
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.36,0:29:06.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.33,0:29:22.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.67,0:29:25.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I invited you in a friendly manner, was it necessary to scare me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.13,0:29:27.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.63,0:29:32.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, if the ice stone is unsealed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.09,0:29:34.55,general text,,0,0,0,,bloodshed will begin again
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.14,0:29:36.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.30,0:29:37.97,italics,,0,0,0,,Is it because of the nomads?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.06,0:29:39.64,general text,,0,0,0,,People used
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.72,0:29:42.73,general text,,0,0,0,,reflectors for the alchemy of souls after the Great Chaos
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.44,0:29:47.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently someone is making reflectors again
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.32,0:29:52.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Ice stone printed
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.87,0:29:59.91,italics,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.99,0:30:02.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is he? In whose hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.96,0:30:04.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it is with those
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.79,0:30:08.29,general text,,0,0,0,,who sent Nak Su and turned the magician of Sosnovy Bor into a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.88,0:30:10.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard Master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.63,0:30:12.92,general text,,0,0,0,,destroyed all the ice stones 200 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.01,0:30:13.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.01,0:30:17.93,general text,,0,0,0,,not all were destroyed, some remained in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.01,0:30:21.56,general text,,0,0,0,,It is not easy to curb human desires
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.64,0:30:22.68,general text,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.02,0:30:25.73,general text,,0,0,0,,return of the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.81,0:30:29.06,general text,,0,0,0,,marks the coming of a man like Master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.28,0:30:35.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Master So Kyung was born under the star of the King
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.90,0:30:38.03,general text,,0,0,0,,However, he did not become king
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.74,0:30:41.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.91,0:30:44.37,general text,,0,0,0,,is there anyone else born under this star?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.21,0:30:51.63,italics,,0,0,0,,Even if it exists, its light will be weak
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.71,0:30:55.92,italics,,0,0,0,,And the energy of the seven stars that surround him has not yet manifested itself
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.01,0:30:59.22,general text,,0,0,0,,A force that can resist nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.30,0:31:03.18,general text,,0,0,0,,and bring chaos to the world, awakened again
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.27,0:31:05.35,italics,,0,0,0,,The one who will stop this will appear
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.23,0:31:07.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Like this
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.60,0:31:11.65,general text,,0,0,0,,balance in the world will be maintained
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.65,0:31:22.41,general text,,0,0,0,,What I want to say, there is no point in worrying
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.87,0:31:27.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope this brings you peace
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.71,0:31:35.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your words
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.92,0:31:38.51,italics,,0,0,0,,Now I have to go
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.22,0:31:41.55,general text,,0,0,0,,You refused my gift,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.64,0:31:44.35,general text,,0,0,0,,so I'll take Gviga with me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.06,0:31:48.06,general text,,0,0,0,,- Your Majesty\N- Do as you wish
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.41,0:32:09.54,general text,,0,0,0,,No, wait
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.37,0:32:12.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Are we leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.29,0:32:13.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw everything I wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.30,0:32:19.01,memories italics,,0,0,0,,So there are nomads in my palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.51,0:32:21.14,memories,,0,0,0,,Take him, we don’t need him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.22,0:32:23.80,memories,,0,0,0,,How dare you bring this monster here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.18,0:32:26.93,general text,,0,0,0,,They showed themselves when I instilled fear in them
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.60,0:32:32.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.40,0:32:33.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Not injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.06,0:32:35.86,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.07,0:32:40.03,general text,,0,0,0,,The dog is fine, but I’m not, because of you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.78,0:32:42.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.49,0:32:45.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I got hurt when I fought with these bandits, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.08,0:32:47.87,general text,,0,0,0,,He has a long way to go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.25,0:32:52.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is blood. Hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.88,0:32:54.04,general text,,0,0,0,,This is my blood
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.13,0:32:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,He wasn’t hurt at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.13,0:32:58.17,general text,,0,0,0,,- Blood...\N- You're covered in it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.84,0:33:00.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, good
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.18,0:33:07.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.27,0:33:10.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently yes
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.06,0:33:13.40,general text,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.95,0:33:25.12,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Gwigu belongs to Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.62,0:33:28.54,voiceover,,0,0,0,,How much does he know about Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.54,0:33:31.50,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,And what will Uk do,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.58,0:33:33.37,voiceover,,0,0,0,,when will he find out about Nak Soo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.05,0:33:43.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.59,0:33:45.72,general text,,0,0,0,,All in cuts
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.80,0:33:47.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.64,0:33:50.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you found the nomads? What about the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:52.98,general text,,0,0,0,,You have no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.69,0:33:56.02,general text,,0,0,0,,My soul almost moved from horror
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.61,0:33:59.11,general text,,0,0,0,,They made a scene, but didn’t find anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.19,0:34:02.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Let the dog bite someone
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.24,0:34:04.32,italics,,0,0,0,,Uk
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.40,0:34:06.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Look for the nomad in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.66,0:34:08.99,general text,,0,0,0,,more difficult than in Sosnovy Bor or Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.20,0:34:11.70,general text,,0,0,0,,If things get out of control,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.79,0:34:14.29,general text,,0,0,0,,a conflict will arise between the palace and Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.42,0:34:18.38,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.46,0:34:19.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You need patching up
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.50,0:34:21.51,italics,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.05,0:34:27.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait a little
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:30.22,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince has asked to escort you to his palace
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.81,0:34:33.10,general text,,0,0,0,,- Crown Prince?\N- It's going to rain
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.18,0:34:35.56,general text,,0,0,0,,He wants you to wait for him
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.81,0:34:38.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Lead
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.74,0:34:50.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, send it first
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.58,0:34:52.08,general text,,0,0,0,,in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.25,0:34:54.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Come here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.83,0:34:56.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.18,0:35:12.81,general text,,0,0,0,,You should have told me that they were invited to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.89,0:35:14.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought this would be
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.81,0:35:16.52,general text,,0,0,0,,regular meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.02,0:35:18.06,general text,,0,0,0,,If the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.15,0:35:20.52,general text,,0,0,0,,will suffer, you will turn to stone, like eunuch Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.61,0:35:22.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Useless piece of meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.45,0:35:36.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Someone born under the star of the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.62,0:35:38.92,general text,,0,0,0,,what will repeat the fate of Master So Kyung?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.25,0:35:43.84,general text,,0,0,0,,If it turns out that this star is the fruit of dark magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.80,0:35:46.72,general text,,0,0,0,,The end of Pine Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.68,0:35:53.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I sent Gviga to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:57.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for scaring you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.18,0:35:59.44,general text,,0,0,0,,When the nomad was found in Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.52,0:36:01.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought that they might be in the palace too
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.94,0:36:06.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Recently he even tried to get here
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.90,0:36:09.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that she created it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.11,0:36:10.86,general text,,0,0,0,,and killed Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.29,0:36:16.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.25,0:36:21.08,general text,,0,0,0,,A mercenary who killed many warriors
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.75,0:36:23.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Heads fly off the shoulders where she has been
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.67,0:36:25.55,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s why she’s called that
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.63,0:36:29.22,general text,,0,0,0,,There are rumors that she is a nomad and that she is alive
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.43,0:36:34.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Nomad Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.64,0:36:37.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Interesting rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.63,0:37:15.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope Mu Deok gets caught before the master returns
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.52,0:37:24.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.48,0:37:27.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.48,0:37:30.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe that I killed someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.82,0:37:34.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Come in
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.25,0:37:41.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.66,0:37:44.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Take things and run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.08,0:37:46.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to ask for something
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.71,0:37:48.92,general text,,0,0,0,,The head said to catch you as soon as you appear
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:51.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.17,0:37:52.47,general text,,0,0,0,,you didn’t do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.18,0:37:56.01,general text,,0,0,0,,- Not me\N- Then why did you run away
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.68,0:37:58.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I had to
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.47,0:38:00.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.52,0:38:02.60,general text,,0,0,0,,You have
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.52,0:38:05.40,general text,,0,0,0,,any secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.90,0:38:12.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Young Master
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.32,0:38:15.03,general text,,0,0,0,,aware of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:24.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, you must run away
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.21,0:38:26.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll give you money
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.37,0:38:27.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Run and don’t come back
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.04,0:38:29.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.38,0:38:32.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t leave my master
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.80,0:38:34.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.30,0:38:38.43,general text,,0,0,0,,If you stay close, he will also fall under suspicion
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.51,0:38:39.85,general text,,0,0,0,,If you're worried about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.64,0:38:42.10,general text,,0,0,0,,then help me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.18,0:38:45.10,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t want to talk to the head, you don’t want to run away either
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.69,0:38:47.02,general text,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.69,0:38:50.52,general text,,0,0,0,,We must find the killer
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.98,0:38:56.36,general text,,0,0,0,,The killer kills those who know him by sight
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.41,0:39:03.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Does Gwangju Jeongbugwan live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.29,0:39:06.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently an influential family
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.12,0:39:11.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Does anyone from the Chan family know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.13,0:39:17.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait around the corner. I'll bring this man
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.14,0:39:30.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to ask someone to confirm,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.40,0:39:33.98,general text,,0,0,0,,that I was not in the room when those people were killed
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.36,0:39:36.65,general text,,0,0,0,,And who?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.24,0:39:38.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Mistress Jin from Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.61,0:39:41.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I ran into her there
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.20,0:39:44.37,general text,,0,0,0,,This sissy will not agree to meet you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.62,0:39:46.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.96,0:39:50.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Take me to Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.42,0:39:53.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.03,0:40:21.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, can you help me lift the crutch?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.91,0:40:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.75,0:40:32.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me where I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.04,0:40:37.01,general text,,0,0,0,,At Gwangju Jeonbugwan's house
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.80,0:40:39.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.01,0:40:42.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.36,0:40:56.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.69,0:40:57.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.53,0:41:07.49,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Apparently Moo Deok can see now
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.12,0:41:10.08,offscreen,,0,0,0,,But she didn’t recognize me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.87,0:41:12.54,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I hope this is for the better
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.17,0:41:17.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.21,0:41:21.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I was wrong. We don't know her at all
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.55,0:41:24.97,general text,,0,0,0,,We're done. Let's return to Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.15,0:41:38.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I try?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.78,0:41:39.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- No\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.73,0:41:41.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.95,0:41:43.86,italics,,0,0,0,,I'm wet
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.95,0:41:45.57,general text,,0,0,0,,This is that umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:47.12,memories,,0,0,0,,This is an umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.08,0:41:49.95,memories,,0,0,0,,Can be used as a cane
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.96,0:41:55.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Mom will scold me, stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.58,0:41:56.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.17,0:41:59.42,general text,,0,0,0,,- No way\N- Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.71,0:42:03.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to exchange umbrellas with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.60,0:42:11.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard Nak Soo moved
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.98,0:42:15.73,general text,,0,0,0,,into the body of a tall, well-built young man
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.81,0:42:19.32,general text,,0,0,0,,She could move into the body of a small, weak woman
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.40,0:42:26.03,general text,,0,0,0,,With such a weak body, there would be no point in touching her
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.91,0:42:30.04,general text,,0,0,0,,But no
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.58,0:42:32.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su in blue was definitely a man
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.58,0:42:35.00,general text,,0,0,0,,"Nak Su in blue"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.08,0:42:38.46,general text,,0,0,0,,- I heard about it\N- He was all in blue
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.54,0:42:42.63,general text,,0,0,0,,It spread everywhere, people started walking around in blue
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.71,0:42:45.09,general text,,0,0,0,,They thought that then
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.18,0:42:48.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su in blue will protect them from the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.93,0:42:51.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su was a mercenary,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.22,0:42:56.14,general text,,0,0,0,,but she didn’t kill ordinary people, and she didn’t have the strength
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.78,0:43:04.65,general text,,0,0,0,,People can be so stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.74,0:43:06.32,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not stupidity
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.20,0:43:08.45,general text,,0,0,0,,This is fear
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.20,0:43:13.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su’s body was burned, everyone knows it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.66,0:43:17.46,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the work of the powerful and influential
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.25,0:43:20.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Call them fools,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.67,0:43:23.84,general text,,0,0,0,,when they are just scared, wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.10,0:43:36.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I gathered you in the hope of finding a solution,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.81,0:43:40.02,general text,,0,0,0,,but you have the nerve to sit here and criticize me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.27,0:43:46.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand, you want to humiliate each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.07,0:43:50.24,general text,,0,0,0,,but I hope we all start getting along
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.16,0:43:53.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li is also with us
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.49,0:43:54.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's drink tea
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.75,0:43:59.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.04,0:44:01.38,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.80,0:44:07.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Mistress Ho requests an audience
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.63,0:44:08.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Let her in
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.14,0:44:18.43,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.52,0:44:20.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard someone was hurt after the fight
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.56,0:44:23.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to check
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.32,0:44:27.61,italics,,0,0,0,,Only one was hurt here
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.69,0:44:30.57,general text,,0,0,0,,- Take him away and heal\N- I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.66,0:44:32.16,general text,,0,0,0,,It won’t be long
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.24,0:44:33.45,italics,,0,0,0,,Walk with me
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.84,0:44:48.51,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that Chan Wook will be engaged again
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.59,0:44:49.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Once again?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.72,0:44:51.72,general text,,0,0,0,,- What does this mean?\N{\i1}- Don’t you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.80,0:44:54.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you really know nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.10,0:44:56.10,italics,,0,0,0,,Rumors are circulating in Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.18,0:44:59.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You three are potential candidates for the role of Master Ho Yeom's son-in-law
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.48,0:45:02.15,general text,,0,0,0,,UK is third in the list
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.23,0:45:04.06,general text,,0,0,0,,But for her, apparently, he is the first
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.02,0:45:06.98,italics,,0,0,0,,Ho Yeom wants to marry her off this year
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:09.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Soon they will be talking about an engagement. I assure you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.87,0:45:19.79,general text,,0,0,0,,The wounds are not deep. These pills will stop the bleeding
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.87,0:45:22.71,general text,,0,0,0,,You should have given them to me right away
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.79,0:45:24.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard about wounds
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.71,0:45:29.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to check it myself to calm down
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.80,0:45:32.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.55,0:45:37.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You were wounded more than once, so this thought arose...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.02,0:45:40.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.98,0:45:42.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.44,0:45:52.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, exactly. Maid Kim gave it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.61,0:45:55.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I haven’t thanked her yet
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.03,0:45:58.33,general text,,0,0,0,,She’s the same
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.62,0:46:04.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Same?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.63,0:46:08.96,general text,,0,0,0,,A hairpin that I saw twenty years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.59,0:46:11.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this something valuable?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.34,0:46:17.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Looks new
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.89,0:46:19.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably not ours
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.68,0:46:22.52,general text,,0,0,0,,But it’s done so similar
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.85,0:46:24.69,italics,,0,0,0,,That’s it
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.35,0:46:27.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently the prince was right
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.44,0:46:30.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Soon we will hear about Uka's engagement
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.69,0:46:32.65,general text,,0,0,0,,But for Master Huo he is third on the list
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.99,0:46:37.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you marry her yourself, since you are the first on this list?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.37,0:46:41.41,general text,,0,0,0,,If you get married, you will have to return to Seho
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.00,0:46:45.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, just don’t get married. I'll be lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.62,0:46:48.92,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I can recognize nomads
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.51,0:47:00.05,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to take it with us to Seho as soon as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.14,0:47:01.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.06,0:47:02.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.11,0:47:10.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I take my words back
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.15,0:47:15.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I felt calmer after seeing your reaction today
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.32,0:47:17.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear that
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.87,0:47:20.91,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you want to ask me personally?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.08,0:47:25.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that you have the sword Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.75,0:47:27.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I pick it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.42,0:47:39.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I watched the show last year
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.22,0:47:41.47,general text,,0,0,0,,There were elephants there
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.97,0:47:45.18,general text,,0,0,0,,But when I go with Dan Gu, I have to pretend that it’s my first time there
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.27,0:47:47.81,general text,,0,0,0,,So those tickets were for you and Mr. Dan Gu?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.89,0:47:50.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Scared. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.15,0:47:52.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to ask for a favor
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.77,0:47:53.90,general text,,0,0,0,,About the service?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.94,0:47:56.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t bother
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.40,0:47:59.49,general text,,0,0,0,,No desire to help you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.57,0:48:01.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I am accused of murder
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.95,0:48:03.08,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.16,0:48:05.41,general text,,0,0,0,,You can go to the head of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.12,0:48:08.54,general text,,0,0,0,,and say that you saw me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.67,0:48:13.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to go to the head and admit that I went
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.50,0:48:15.76,general text,,0,0,0,,to such a place?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.46,0:48:18.30,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m not crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.18,0:48:21.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You are my only hope
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.47,0:48:24.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.43,0:48:28.60,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.68,0:48:30.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I told Dan Gu that I have an extra ticket
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.69,0:48:32.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want him to know where I bought them
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.65,0:48:35.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Your shame will be temporary,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.36,0:48:37.36,general text,,0,0,0,,and they can kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:40.40,general text,,0,0,0,,If mom finds out, I won’t live either
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.49,0:48:43.24,general text,,0,0,0,,She will never kill her daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.32,0:48:45.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you shouting when you came to ask for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.29,0:48:51.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll have to tell your mother everything myself
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.08,0:48:53.71,general text,,0,0,0,,and ask her for help
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.79,0:48:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Should I ask my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.84,0:48:58.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Here she comes
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.76,0:49:03.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t have bothered with gifts as an apology for the past
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.10,0:49:08.77,general text,,0,0,0,,The more I think about it, the more I want to apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.18,0:49:12.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll go and ask her myself
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.81,0:49:13.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.81,0:49:16.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it. First come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.74,0:49:27.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back. Wait here
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.37,0:49:29.83,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t come back, I’ll scream
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.91,0:49:31.41,general text,,0,0,0,,- I'll be back\N-{\i1} Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.21,0:49:33.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, mother
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.13,0:49:34.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.28,0:50:07.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Very young
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.99,0:50:10.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I wonder who it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.61,0:50:41.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it because of the incense?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.24,0:50:46.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Beautiful vase
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.57,0:50:51.54,general text,,0,0,0,,If you put flowers in this vase, they will smell stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.79,0:50:54.71,general text,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.79,0:50:58.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I have long wanted to change the vase in my daughter’s room
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.04,0:50:59.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.67,0:51:06.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother, will you put a vase in Boo Young unnie’s room?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.80,0:51:08.72,general text,,0,0,0,,The flowers will smell stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.80,0:51:12.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Your sister is blind, so at least she can enjoy the smell of flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.77,0:51:58.10,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.19,0:52:00.02,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in my daughter’s room?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.90,0:52:06.32,general text,,0,0,0,,She came with me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.40,0:52:07.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably lost
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.45,0:52:10.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.99,0:52:14.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.95,0:52:18.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Help once
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.46,0:52:21.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Go away
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.13,0:52:22.96,general text,,0,0,0,,And don’t come back anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.04,0:52:24.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.34,0:52:30.18,italics,,0,0,0,,I'll come. I promise
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.64,0:52:33.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.39,0:52:37.98,general text,,0,0,0,,tell the servants to clean your sister's room again
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.73,0:52:40.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, mother
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.26,0:53:09.26,general text,,0,0,0,,So I
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.26,0:53:12.05,general text,,0,0,0,,This man will be your father
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.01,0:53:14.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.05,0:53:17.47,general text,,0,0,0,,A father wants to bring a fake daughter into the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.85,0:53:24.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I am not Jin Bu Young's father by blood
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.98,0:53:29.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Her real father is someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.66,0:53:44.38,general text,,0,0,0,,To be recognized as the daughter of the Jin family,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.46,0:53:46.34,general text,,0,0,0,,you must open the doors of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.42,0:53:49.84,general text,,0,0,0,,And for this, their blood must flow through your veins
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.72,0:53:55.05,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.14,0:53:58.47,general text,,0,0,0,,A worm containing the blood of a member of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.45,0:54:22.37,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the blood of Cho Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.37,0:54:24.92,general text,,0,0,0,,my favorite
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.79,0:54:28.96,general text,,0,0,0,,And what will you do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.04,0:54:30.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Reach out your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.63,0:54:34.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t keep me waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.68,0:55:20.85,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Now you have the blood of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.93,0:55:24.35,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If I didn’t use dark magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.43,0:55:27.31,voiceover,,0,0,0,,this worm will eat you from the inside
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.65,0:55:30.23,italics,,0,0,0,,Trying to escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.07,0:55:33.36,italics,,0,0,0,,this worm will eat you alive
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.45,0:55:43.12,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the room of her daughter, who died 10 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.29,0:55:45.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently she drowned,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.62,0:55:49.17,general text,,0,0,0,,but Mrs. Jin still thinks she will come back
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.75,0:55:51.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for her
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.92,0:55:54.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Forgive her for the slap
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.72,0:56:00.76,general text,,0,0,0,,And her daughter was blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.68,0:56:03.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.27,0:56:07.48,offscreen,,0,0,0,,The owner of this body was also blind
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.27,0:56:10.60,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Maybe that’s why I felt something strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.08,0:56:31.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li wanted to talk about something with the prince alone
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.83,0:56:32.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.01,0:56:40.97,general text,,0,0,0,,The head asked to accompany you to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.55,0:56:43.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Me? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.64,0:56:44.64,italics,,0,0,0,,Come with us
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.15,0:56:56.73,general text,,0,0,0,,They’ll lock me up here again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.23,0:56:59.07,general text,,0,0,0,,- What's going on?\N- This...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.78,0:57:01.11,general text,,0,0,0,,We are ordered to be silent
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.91,0:57:03.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Wait for him here
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.83,0:57:16.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok was seen next to the bodies, it’s clear why she was taken away
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.17,0:57:18.67,general text,,0,0,0,,But why, sir? He was in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.05,0:57:22.59,general text,,0,0,0,,What is the head thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.68,0:57:23.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.31,0:57:27.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.43,0:57:29.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok will not kill anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.18,0:57:31.27,italics,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.36,0:57:36.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I look at the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.41,0:57:51.29,general text,,0,0,0,,The killer wielded the sword skillfully
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.91,0:57:53.54,general text,,0,0,0,,This can’t be Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.17,0:57:56.75,offscreen,,0,0,0,,But she is Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.71,0:57:59.46,offscreen,,0,0,0,,She could have killed them
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.64,0:58:07.55,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I have my reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.64,0:58:09.06,memories italics,,0,0,0,,don’t bother me
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.64,0:58:15.48,general text,,0,0,0,,- These are those bandits\N- Do you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.77,0:58:20.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I fought them not long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.28,0:58:27.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I take their bodies and conduct a funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.37,0:58:36.50,general text,,0,0,0,,What brought Chief Chwisonra here?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.58,0:58:38.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Did someone die?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.17,0:58:40.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Our guards were killed
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.93,0:58:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.39,0:58:57.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim told about what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.23,0:59:00.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.61,0:59:03.24,general text,,0,0,0,,help Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.12,0:59:13.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I went there to buy tickets
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.71,0:59:17.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Deok was there
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.67,0:59:20.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.79,0:59:24.59,general text,,0,0,0,,it was my first time in such a place
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.17,0:59:26.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.09,0:59:30.85,general text,,0,0,0,,We talked a little, and then Moo Deok came in
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.93,0:59:32.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw you too as you entered
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.81,0:59:38.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course, I didn’t think I’d see you in such a place
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.94,0:59:41.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.57,0:59:45.99,general text,,0,0,0,,This is what happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.03,0:59:51.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok would never have had enough time to kill those men
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.16,0:59:55.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Recently a girl came to Chwisung-ru, looking for Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.45,0:59:56.91,general text,,0,0,0,,She pretended to be a magician
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.00,0:59:58.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Chwisongru thinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.58,1:00:02.54,general text,,0,0,0,,this could be So Yi, the girl the merchant warned Moo Deok about
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.63,1:00:05.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I once saw a girl being dragged by these bandits
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.34,1:00:07.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Trader,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.67,1:00:08.97,general text,,0,0,0,,bandits and guards
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.84,1:00:12.10,general text,,0,0,0,,They all intersected with this So I
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.18,1:00:14.01,general text,,0,0,0,,This scammer So Yi is very suspicious
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.89,1:00:17.14,general text,,0,0,0,,This means Moo Deok is not to blame
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.69,1:00:19.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.73,1:00:25.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I myself doubted that Moo Dok could kill someone
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.40,1:00:29.53,general text,,0,0,0,,That's it. You knew, uncle, that Moo Deok was not capable of this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.61,1:00:33.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you let Wook and Moo Deok go now?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.24,1:00:35.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I locked them up so that
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.37,1:00:38.33,general text,,0,0,0,,ask something
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.37,1:00:40.87,italics,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the rest myself
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.96,1:00:42.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You can go
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.17,1:00:43.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.27,1:01:03.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.27,1:01:06.90,general text,,0,0,0,,At least tell me what’s wrong
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.69,1:01:10.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok committed murder
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.28,1:01:14.28,general text,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.37,1:01:17.45,general text,,0,0,0,,She killed those who knew her in the past
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.62,1:01:24.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you and Moo Deok are hiding
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.84,1:01:28.30,general text,,0,0,0,,If your words do not coincide with Moo Deok’s words,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.88,1:01:31.22,general text,,0,0,0,,you will not leave this room
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.05,1:01:33.80,general text,,0,0,0,,And Moo Deok will die
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.12,1:01:56.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter, listen...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.74,1:01:58.08,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not about murder
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.04,1:02:02.00,general text,,0,0,0,,UK revealed your secret to me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.29,1:02:04.54,general text,,0,0,0,,He told everything
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.13,1:02:12.05,general text,,0,0,0,,If you also tell the truth, I will spare your life
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.18,1:02:14.34,general text,,0,0,0,,But if,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.43,1:02:17.51,general text,,0,0,0,,your words will differ,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.43,1:02:20.89,general text,,0,0,0,,you will die
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.82,1:02:31.69,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If he knew that she was a nomad,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.78,1:02:33.74,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,wouldn’t waste time like this
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.82,1:02:36.41,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He is trying to split us by interrogating us separately
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.24,1:02:39.58,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,We must say the same thing
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.37,1:02:44.62,voiceover,,0,0,0,,What would Chan Wook answer?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.71,1:02:48.54,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,A secret that we both are guaranteed to reveal
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.63,1:02:53.22,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,A secret, the disclosure of which will not lead to my death
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.30,1:02:57.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.84,1:02:59.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I confess to you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.90,1:03:08.36,general text,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.36,1:03:11.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Deok and Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.19,1:03:13.32,general text,,0,0,0,,you can let go
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.82,1:03:16.86,general text,,0,0,0,,What did they say? One and the same?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.08,1:03:23.08,general text,,0,0,0,,They said... the same thing
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.57,1:03:55.44,general text,,0,0,0,,- You left\N- You too
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.03,1:03:58.91,general text,,0,0,0,,- Glad you're okay\N- Me too
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.99,1:04:00.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, we said the same thing
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.37,1:04:03.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.95,1:04:05.66,general text,,0,0,0,,We both left...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.04,1:04:09.04,general text,,0,0,0,,so you said the same thing
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.00,1:04:17.47,general text,,0,0,0,,You locked them up to find out what they were hiding
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.55,1:04:19.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you found out something
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.55,1:04:20.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.47,1:04:22.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What’s their secret?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.76,1:04:25.18,general text,,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.27,1:04:29.73,general text,,0,0,0,,literally left me speechless
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.56,1:04:35.19,general text,,0,0,0,,They showed the same thing
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.11,1:04:38.49,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I will tell the truth
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.40,1:04:41.03,memories,,0,0,0,,I tried not to get caught
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.28,1:04:44.08,memories,,0,0,0,,This is what I was hiding
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.72,1:05:03.22,memories,,0,0,0,,You see, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.72,1:05:06.10,memories,,0,0,0,,Actually I...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.06,1:05:14.69,memories,,0,0,0,,love Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.53,1:05:20.36,memories,,0,0,0,,I love the owner very much
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.74,1:05:29.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd probably admit it
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.04,1:05:33.42,general text,,0,0,0,,They wouldn’t kill me for this
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.50,1:05:37.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, and there is nothing about this in the Sosnovy Bor rule book
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.34,1:05:39.71,general text,,0,0,0,,There is no prohibition for a boy to love a girl
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.88,1:05:43.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.80,1:05:47.85,general text,,0,0,0,,And a servant’s love for her master will not lead to death
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.93,1:05:53.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that what you said? Why do you love me to death?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.98,1:05:56.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.82,1:06:00.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I exaggerated so that he would believe
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.28,1:06:04.82,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no other choice
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.20,1:06:09.70,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no choice but to admit that you love me to death
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.91,1:06:12.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m somehow sorry even
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.33,1:06:15.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t put so much feeling into my confession
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.25,1:06:17.54,general text,,0,0,0,,We had to try
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.63,1:06:18.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.59,1:06:24.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t put everything on the line for something as fickle as love
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.93,1:06:27.85,general text,,0,0,0,,If this happens again,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.60,1:06:30.89,general text,,0,0,0,,and life will depend on the choice,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.98,1:06:33.23,general text,,0,0,0,,betray love
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.52,1:06:35.73,general text,,0,0,0,,and choose life
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.11,1:06:39.73,italics,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, you want to die
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.65,1:06:42.19,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the teacher’s order
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.24,1:06:48.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.08,1:06:50.62,general text,,0,0,0,,what if I don’t mind dying?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.41,1:06:53.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I continue to love you then?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.29,1:06:58.42,general text,,0,0,0,,In other words, I’m ready to risk everything,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.38,1:07:01.17,general text,,0,0,0,,so that we can be together
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.55,1:07:04.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll do it
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.72,1:07:09.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Do the same, stick to your confession
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.72,1:07:12.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Love me to death
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.81,1:07:55.73,preview,,0,0,0,,If Uk loves someone he shouldn’t,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.81,1:07:57.23,preview,,0,0,0,,what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.31,1:08:01.27,preview,,0,0,0,,If I'm with you, I need to make sure that you're mine
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.36,1:08:03.23,preview,,0,0,0,,How dare you disgrace Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.98,1:08:05.03,preview,,0,0,0,,- Salty\N- Two boots - a pair
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.11,1:08:06.40,preview,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you get married?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.49,1:08:08.24,preview,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for shaman Choi
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.32,1:08:11.16,preview,,0,0,0,,If the shaman was hunted by the magicians of Jeonbugwan...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.24,1:08:14.08,preview,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for her because she harbors a grudge against your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.16,1:08:16.87,preview,,0,0,0,,If he comes, report immediately
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.96,1:08:18.54,preview,,0,0,0,,Even dead, this is Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.62,1:08:20.50,preview,,0,0,0,,Pretend you don’t know, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.17,1:08:23.75,preview,,0,0,0,,It was hard for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.84,1:08:26.17,preview,,0,0,0,,If you have to draw a sword and point it at someone,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.26,1:08:28.55,preview,,0,0,0,,let me be the first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,

